   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>Kiran creates a scatter plot showing the relationship between the number of students attending drama club and the number of students attending poetry club each week. The correlation coefficient for the line of best fit is –0.36. Are they strongly correlated? Be prepared to show your reasoning.</li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1224328,
     "content_html": "Yes, the correlation coefficient is close to 0."
    },
    {
     "id": 1224327,
     "content_html": "No, the correlation coefficient is negative."
    },
    {
     "id": 1224326,
     "content_html": "Yes, the correlation coefficient is more than 0."
    },
    {
     "id": 1224329,
     "content_html": "No, the correlation coefficient is closer to 0."
    }
